<review_text>
Great phone system - we like having a corded base (great in power failure!) with a speaker phone (especially handy when you are put on hold or have to negotiate through those automatic phone menu system). An answering machine is great too instead of voice mail, especially for screening calls & also knowing when you have a message (rather than having to check your dial tone). The cordless phone is also really nice - great reception, just the right size and weight and both have nice sized, clear & easy to use buttons & features.
We've never had a Uniden before but are really happy with our purchase. 
</review_text>
