<review_text>
The title of this review says it all.  I still can't believe the massively great sound that this little baby puts out.  I was originally looking for a nice set of headphones for my MP3 player, but now, they've become my standard set for my home theatre.  My friend had recommended these to me about a week before I bought them, and man was he right about one thing; GREAT BASS! These phones really show me how far technology has come these days.  It really DOES sound like 2 little 1&quot; subs next to your ears.  Not only is the bass amazing, but every little treb and mid is easily recognizable with amazing clarity.  I plan to use these as long they'll still function, and then I'll just buy another pair.  Great job Koss
</review_text>
</review>
