B0000E2PMB:it_really_does_work!:c._sims
</unique_id>
<asin>
B0000E2PMB
</asin>
<product_name>
Monster Cable MP HTS 1000 PowerCenter with Clean Power Stage 2 (v.2.0): Electronics
</product_name>
