I joined VONAGE & needed a phone that would work wirelessly as VONAGE rendered the telephone wiring in my house useless.  I bought one extension & it's been OK.   The 5.8 gig size provides plenty of coverage throughout my tiny house.  The one thing that doesn't work well for me is the Toll Saver feature when calling to check messages - it may be the phone or it may be related to VONAGE, but I had to set it to five rings for checking messages. It would be nicer to have Toll Saver work properly, but otherwise the thing works well.  I don't fax a lot but the few occasions I do, it's fairly OK - again, any problems I have may be related more to the VONAGE/phone interface
