<review_text>
I bought this inverter for an extended road trip to power a laptop, phone & battery chargers and to power an electronic menagerie.  It worked perfectly even with both outlets under full load.  Fan is audible but not abhorrent; unit stays reasonably balmy, never searing  it may warm your Dr. Pepper but not cook your Cole Haans.  This unit replaced a lower capacity inverter that couldn't keep up with the laptop's power supply but this 375-watt workhorse gets the job done sans drama.  Highly recommended
</review_text>
</review>
